Y","q":"At room temperature the average seed of Helium is higher than that of Oxygen by a factor of","options":["$2 \\sqrt{2}$","$6 / \\sqrt{2}$","8","6"],"answer":0,"solution":"average speed $\\alpha \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M}}\\begin{array}{l}\n\\frac{V_{H e}}{V_{O_{2}}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{32}{4}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{M_{\\mathrm{O}_{2}}}{M_{\\text {He }}}} \\\\\n=\\sqrt{8}=2 \\sqrt{2}\n\\end{array}$","difficulty":"Medium","source":"KVPY 2014 (SA)","_marksId":"6174d213f15717ff8eabfafc"},{"id":51410,"subject":"Chemistry","chapter":"States of Matter","exam":"Engineering","examName":"KVPY","q":"Typical electronic energy gaps in molecules are about $1.0 \\mathrm{eV}$. In terms of temperature, the gap is closed to -","options":["$10^{2} \\mathrm{~K}$","$10^{4} \\mathrm{~K}$","$10^{3} \\mathrm{~K}$","$10^{5} \\mathrm{~K}$"],"answer":3,"solution":"$\\begin{array}{l}\n\\frac{3}{2} \\mathrm{KT}=1.6 \\times 10^{-19} \\\\\n\\frac{3}{2} \\times 1.38 \\times 10^{-23}=1.6 \\times 10^{-19} \\\\\n\\mathrm{~T}=10^{5} \\mathrm{~K}\n\\end{array}$","difficulty":"Medium","source":"KVPY 2012 (SB/SX)","_marksId":"6174d213314415b3969b5160"},{"id":51411,"subject":"Chemistry","chapter":"States of Matter","exam":"Engineering","examName":"KVPY","q":"The graph that does not represent the behaviour of an ideal gas is -","options":["<img src=\"/api/proxy-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fquantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app%2Fo%2Fquestions%252Ffigs%252Fpyq%252Fkvpy%252FAIA6-c57cwxjrBouZg5u-imferwPhQSy8jwP-brs1D8.original.fullsize.png%3Falt%3Dmedia&clean=1&v=wm2\" data-qx-orig-src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fkvpy%2FAIA6-c57cwxjrBouZg5u-imferwPhQSy8jwP-brs1D8.original.fullsize.png?alt=media\" data-qx-storage-src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fkvpy%2FAIA6-c57cwxjrBouZg5u-imferwPhQSy8jwP-brs1D8.original.fullsize.png?al